  "post_content": "<p>La Uni&oacute; Musical Santa Cec&iacute;lia de Suera ha festejat aquest cap de setmana la seua patrona amb diferents actes. Diumenge de mat&iacute; es va fer una missa, amb un cercavila previ, encap&ccedil;alat per la Mussa, Mar&iacute;a Jos&eacute; Serrano, que va ser proclamada dissabte de vesprada. Un sopar i un dinar van completar la celebraci&oacute;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santaceciliasuera12/img_8801.jpg\" alt=\"img_8801\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santaceciliasuera12/img_8802.jpg\" alt=\"img_8802\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santaceciliasuera12/img_8803.jpg\" alt=\"img_8803\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santaceciliasuera12/img_8804.jpg\" alt=\"img_8804\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santaceciliasuera12/img_8805.jpg\" alt=\"img_8805\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santaceciliasuera12/img_8806.jpg\" alt=\"img_8806\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
